      "writtenOn": "2024-10-22T17:19:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we need this tag? aren\u0027t we just going to end up with a bunch of them or does it combine them all? What happens if we remove it during gardening?",
      "revId": "fe3f0176e41734ce9fda5f7bee01ca136a09d39f",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a708b5f8_af121a01",
        "filename": "tools/src/cts/expectations/update_test.go",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 980,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000193
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-10-22T17:44:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The tag isn\u0027t strictly necessary, as we could just append new expectations to the bottom of the file. This allows us to keep all the untriaged/auto-generated expectations together and sorted, though.\n\nThere will only ever be one of these in the file at a time - the tool adds expectations to the existing one, and if it finds more than one, it raises an error. If a chunk with this comment doesn\u0027t exist (e.g. if it gets removed during gardening), the tool will automatically create one at the end of the file.",
      "parentUuid": "e4bef541_ce8058de",
      "revId": "fe3f0176e41734ce9fda5f7bee01ca136a09d39f",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "732a2d18_92fbcf1c",
        "filename": "tools/src/cts/expectations/update_test.go",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 980,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000257
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-10-22T17:56:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So, that means we end up with two sorted blocks, one for roller added and one for gardeners? It seems like it would be more useful if it all sorted together?",
      "parentUuid": "a708b5f8_af121a01",
      "revId": "fe3f0176e41734ce9fda5f7bee01ca136a09d39f",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c9eb9e22_d87f14fd",
        "filename": "tools/src/cts/expectations/update_test.go",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 980,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000193
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-10-22T18:09:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Gardeners are free to add expectations to this block if they want. I thought the process was that auto-generated expectations would be moved out, grouped together, and bugs updated based on having the same root cause once someone actually got around to taking a look, but there\u0027s nothing that actually enforces that. People can add any expectations in this block and the tool will happily keep them/sort them the next time it is run.\n\nReally all this comment does is tell the tool \"add any new expectations here\".",
      "parentUuid": "732a2d18_92fbcf1c",
      "revId": "fe3f0176e41734ce9fda5f7bee01ca136a09d39f",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
